@* The fallback is not a spinner: it is what a reader sees when the image is missing, slow, or
   blocked — which on a real network is often. *@
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
    <Avatar>
        <AvatarImage src="https://placehold.co/64" alt="" />
        <AvatarFallback>MR</AvatarFallback>
    </Avatar>
    <Avatar><AvatarFallback>AL</AvatarFallback></Avatar>
</div>
